OFFICIAL-SENSITIVE

All,

Cumberland Council has opened Keswick School as a rest centre from 1500. Residents from
low-lying streets in Keswick are being advised to go there. British Red Cross volunteers are on site.

The A591 Kewsick to Grasmere at Thirlmere was closed by our highways team at 1400 because of flooding.

